n-detailed errors and V9 type/reason object branch. The detailed writer includes root_cause. This source prediction is not runtime evidence.","Exact RestResponse emits V8 non-detailed deprecation warning. Rank handler retains literal GET/POST routes and source-media validation."],"native_plan":["Keep exact owned 9.0.8 main/image. Use the default-detail main and a same-image isolated sibling with detail=false. No next version or image download.","For each detail mode compare ordinary JSON and V8 compatibility media, each with GET /, malformed POST /_rank_eval, and invalid source_content_type GET /_rank_eval. No cluster/index mutation, auth or private/paid route.","Record every readiness request separately. Preserve method, path, status, selected headers, bounded excerpt, response length and SHA; no full response archive. Enforce per-call deadlines, size limits and disk admission.","Commit sources and producer before execution. Review all selected responses, compare identical errors across modes, freeze main matrix before final cleanup."],"limits":["Only exact 9.0.8 and the same two public error cases; other exceptions, auth/TLS and consumers remain open."]},"primary_sources":[{"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/http/HttpTransportSettings.java","source_commit":"936f7cf370e0d7952bb71a98629284c3c0e0d00e","local_source":"docs/research/source-analysis/9.0.8/error-shape-sources/HttpTransportSettings.java","sha256":"19d6350636d95658777c0eebd79b355d8e14c5bbbd6ce58c060f9db25e2be6bf","git_blob":"f55087522b20f2d126d879a088b29739f156ebdd","url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/936f7cf370e0d7952bb71a98629284c3c0e0d00e/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/http/HttpTransportSettings.java","retained_url":"primary-sources/19d6350636d95658777c0eebd79b355d8e14c5bbbd6ce58c060f9db25e2be6bf-HttpTransportSettings.java"},{"path":"server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/http/AbstractHttpServerTransport.java","source_commit":"936f7cf370e0d7952bb71a98629284c3c0e0d00e